      "statement": "UserDurableObject ids derive from a name: idFromName(username) for password accounts and idFromName(email) for Cloudflare Access and gatekeeper sign-in, making the provider-verified email the canonical account key so any allowlisted gatekeeper yielding the same verified email resolves to the same account; profile display names are written only on first sign-in and later logins never clobber a customized name.",
