      "id": "claim_6176e652d90244bd800635db5fb0328b",
      "statement": "Password hashing is client-side argon2id (parallelism 1, 3 iterations, 64 MiB, 32-byte output) over SERVICE_SALT + utf8(username), with the salt constant shared through workshop-shared; the server stores only a further SHA-256 of that hash, so the server never sees the password and the expensive hash runs on the client.",
