    {
      "id": "claim_c09cc6713c374acda72cb496a8a5777d",
      "statement": "Gatekeeper sign-in: startGatekeeperLogin validates the vendor against the AUTH_GATEKEEPERS allowlist and its providesAuth declaration, creates a storage-less PendingLogin DO bridging the OAuth pop-up back to the waiting browser, and returns {url, attempt} where attempt is a capability stub (never a guessable id) whose disposal abandons the attempt and lets the DO be evicted; on completion the callback reads the provider-verified email, resolves/creates the email-keyed User DO honoring the signups gate, mints a session, and delivers the token through the PendingLogin DO.",
